# Twin Peaks goals (data/goals.json, route twinpeaks) on the autopilot's race: Twin Peaks at 56
# (it tops out at 58.7 km/h before Douglass), Under 110 and No Brakes (103.53 s, never braking).
# The Dolores goals stay open: they name the Dolores route.
park sf
spawn valencia_shops
cmd 0 traffic clear
cmd 0 run bomb twinpeaks
bot line twin_peaks_line 6
run 12800
expect event goalComplete{id=tp56,area=Twin Peaks} within 4914..4934
expect event goalComplete{id=tp110} within 12676..12696
expect event goalComplete{id=tpnobrakes} within 12676..12696
expect no event goalComplete{id=bomb11}
expect no event goalComplete{id=nobrakes}
